<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
        <LangVersion>14</LangVersion>
        <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
        <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
        <WarningsAsErrors>CS8509</WarningsAsErrors>
        <Title>DiffToJson.Lib</Title>
        <Authors>Alastair Lundy</Authors>
        <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
        <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
        <PackageId>DiffToJson.Lib</PackageId>
        <Copyright>Copyright (c) Alastair Lundy 2026</Copyright>
        <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/alastairlundy/difftojson</RepositoryUrl>
        <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>🆕 Additions

- Added a `Reasoning` module with per-model wire-format support: `ReasoningEffort`, `IReasoningEffortMatrix`/`ReasoningEffortMatrix`, and `IChatOptionsBuilder`/`ChatOptionsBuilder`.
- Added `PromptSubstitutor` for template placeholder substitution.
- Added the `AssistantMessageResult` hierarchy and `IAssistantMessageGenerator` interface for assistant message generation.
- Added `TrainingExampleOptions` and `DisabledAssistantMessageGenerator`.
- Added `RedactionPolicy` with commit- and string-level redaction controls.
- Added the `TrainingExampleBuilder` core pipeline for constructing training examples.

⚙️ Modifications

- Extracted a pure `GitLogParser` state machine from `GitCommitParser`.
- Shrunk `IGitCommitParser` and reworked `GitCommitParser` as a thin shell.
- Refactored `LlmAssistantWriter` to implement `IAssistantMessageGenerator`.
- Enabled `TreatWarningsAsErrors`/`CS8509` configuration in the project.
- Added `PackageReleaseNotes` documenting the `IGitCommitParser` API shrink and raw-path redaction change.
- Updated project dependencies to support the reasoning-effort feature.
</PackageReleaseNotes>
        <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
        <Version>0.5.0</Version>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
      <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DiffToJsonLib.Tests" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
      <PackageReference Include="Anthropic" />
      <PackageReference Include="CliInvoke.Core"/>
      <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions"/>
      <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI" />
      <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Compliance.Redaction"/>
      <PackageReference Include="OllamaSharp" />
      <PackageReference Include="Polly" />
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
